note forbnd benchmark mb-axpy (body after a lead line): 20000 passes of y[i] = y[i] + 3 x[i] over 4096
note ulong elements (wrapping). Three checks per element (get y i, get x i, put y i) are erasable.
global x ulong 4096
global y ulong 4096
fn main to int
for i ulong 4096
put x i i
put y i 1
end
for r ulong 20000
for i ulong 4096
put y i add get y i mul 3 get x i
end
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4096
s = xor s get y i
end
ret int rem s 251
end
